 "note": "Client side: an r7 host ignores the unknown hello.revision and welcomes without revision (or names another one). The r8 client refuses the attachment: it enables no feature, sends no list, acquire, chat open or terminal request, and applies nothing the host sends afterwards. It reports that the host's Atem must be updated. No fallback to r7 behaviour."
